.550" end="00:20.390">oh </span><span begin="00:20.390" end="00:26.570">ohh</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.600" end="00:29.660"><span begin="00:26.600" end="00:26.780">She </span><span begin="00:26.780" end="00:27.200">said </span><span begin="00:27.200" end="00:27.230">i </span><span begin="00:27.230" end="00:27.560">love </span><span begin="00:27.560" end="00:27.680">you </span><span begin="00:27.680" end="00:27.950">more </span><span begin="00:27.950" end="00:28.070">than </span><span begin="00:28.070" end="00:28.550">words </span><span begin="00:28.550" end="00:28.700">can </span><span begin="00:28.700" end="00:29.660">say</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.870" end="00:36.890"><span begin="00:29.870" end="00:30.050">She </span><span begin="00:30.050" end="00:30.440">said </span><span begin="00:30.440" end="00:30.470">i </span><span begin="00:30.470" end="00:30.830">love </span><span begin="00:30.830" end="00:30.950">you </span><span begin="00:30.950" end="00:36.890">bayayayayby</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.150" end="00:52.910"><span begin="00:47.150" end="00:47.360">So </span><span begin="00:47.360" end="00:47.480">i </span><span begin="00:47.480" end="00:48.410">said</span><span begin="00:48.410" end="00:49.340">, </span><span begin="00:49.340" end="00:50.000">what </span><span begin="00:50.000" end="00:50.060">you </span><span begin="00:50.060" end="00:50.570">sayin </span><span begin="00:50.570" end="00:50.960">girl </span><span begin="00:50.960" end="00:51.110">it </span><span begin="00:51.110" end="00:51.590">can't </span><span begin="00:51.590" end="00:51.800">be </span><span begin="00:51.800" end="00:52.910">right</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.090" end="00:55.910"><span begin="00:53.090" end="00:53.360">How </span><span begin="00:53.360" end="00:53.690">can </span><span begin="00:53.690" end="00:53.810">you </span><span begin="00:53.810" end="00:54.050">be </span><span begin="00:54.050" end="00:54.230">in </span><span begin="00:54.230" end="00:54.560">love </span><span begin="00:54.560" end="00:54.770">with </span><span begin="00:54.770" end="00:55.910">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.420" end="00:59.540"><span begin="00:56.420" end="00:56.660">We </span><span begin="00:56.660" end="00:57.080">only </span><span begin="00:57.080" end="00:57.440">just </span><span begin="00:57.440" end="00:57.920">met </span><span begin="00:57.920" end="00:59.540">tonight</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.020" end="01:05.900"><span begin="01:00.020" end="01:00.260">So </span><span begin="01:00.260" end="01:00.470">she </span><span begin="01:00.470" end="01:01.850">said</span><span begin="01:01.850" end="01:02.510">.</span><span begin="01:02.510" end="01:03.170">. </span><span begin="01:03.170" end="01:03.560">boy </span><span begin="01:03.560" end="01:03.710">i </span><span begin="01:03.710" end="01:04.070">loved </span><span begin="01:04.070" end="01:04.250">you </span><span begin="01:04.250" end="01:04.760">from </span><span begin="01:04.760" end="01:04.850">the </span><span begin="01:04.850" end="01:05.900">start</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.050" end="01:08.960"><span begin="01:06.050" end="01:06.350">When </span><span begin="01:06.350" end="01:06.500">i </span><span begin="01:06.500" end="01:07.100">first </span><span begin="01:07.100" end="01:07.340">heard </span><span begin="01:07.340" end="01:07.730">love </span><span begin="01:07.730" end="01:08.120">goes </span><span begin="01:08.120" end="01:08.960">down</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.170" end="01:12.620"><span begin="01:09.170" end="01:09.680">Something </span><span begin="01:09.680" end="01:10.160">started </span><span begin="01:10.160" end="01:10.670">burning </span><span begin="01:10.670" end="01:10.910">in </span><span begin="01:10.910" end="01:11.150">my </span><span begin="01:11.150" end="01:12.620">heart</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.130" end="01:17.990"><span begin="01:13.130" end="01:13.340">I </span><span begin="01:13.340" end="01:13.580">said </span><span begin="01:13.580" end="01:14.210">stop </span><span begin="01:14.210" end="01:14.450">this </span><span begin="01:14.450" end="01:15.440">crazy </span><span begin="01:15.440" end="01:17.990">talk</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.280" end="01:24.500"><span begin="01:19.280" end="01:19.490">And </span><span begin="01:19.490" end="01:19.910">leave </span><span begin="01:19.910" end="01:20.240">right </span><span begin="01:20.240" end="01:20.840">now </span><span begin="01:20.840" end="01:20.930">and </span><span begin="01:20.930" end="01:21.680">close </span><span begin="01:21.680" end="01:21.740">the </span><span begin="01:21.740" end="01:24.500">door</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.530" end="01:28.160"><span begin="01:24.530" end="01:24.740">She </span><span begin="01:24.740" end="01:25.610">said </span><span begin="01:25.610" end="01:25.940">but </span><span begin="01:25.940" end="01:26.000">i </span><span begin="01:26.000" end="01:26.330">love </span><span begin="01:26.330" end="01:26.420">you </span><span begin="01:26.420" end="01:26.720">boy </span><span begin="01:26.720" end="01:26.810">i </span><span begin="01:26.810" end="01:27.320">love </span><span begin="01:27.320" end="01:27.440">you </span><span begin="01:27.440" end="01:28.160">so</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.670" end="01:38.450"><span begin="01:28.670" end="01:28.850">She </span><span begin="01:28.850" end="01:29.240">said </span><span begin="01:29.240" end="01:29.270">i </span><span begin="01:29.270" end="01:29.600">love </span><span begin="01:29.600" end="01:29.720">you </span><span begin="01:29.720" end="01:30.200">baby </span><span begin="01:30.200" end="01:30.980">oh </span><span begin="01:30.980" end="01:31.400">oh </span><span begin="01:31.400" end="01:36.650">oh </span><span begin="01:36.650" end="01:38.450">oh</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.450" end="01:41.330"><span begin="01:38.450" end="01:38.630">She </span><span begin="01:38.630" end="01:39.020">said </span><span begin="01:39.020" end="01:39.050">i </span><span begin="01:39.050" end="01:39.410">love </span><span begin="01:39.410" end="01:39.500">you </span><span begin="01:39.500" end="01:39.800">more </span><span begin="01:39.800" end="01:39.920">than </span><span begin="01:39.920" end="01:40.400">words </span><span begin="01:40.400" end="01:40.550">can </span><span begin="01:40.550" end="01:41.330">say</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.720" end="01:51.800"><span begin="01:41.720" end="01:41.930">She </span><span begin="01:41.930" end="01:42.320">said </span><span begin="01:42.320" end="01:42.350">i </span><span begin="01:42.350" end="01:42.710">love </span><span begin="01:42.710" end="01:42.800">you </span><span begin="01:42.800" end="01:48.890">bayayayayby </span><span begin="01:48.890" end="01:48.890">（</span><span begin="01:48.890" end="01:49.220">yes </span><span begin="01:49.220" end="01:49.400">you </span><span begin="01:49.400" end="01:50.330">did</span><span begin="01:50.330" end="01:51.800">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.800" end="01:53.030"><span begin="01:51.800" end="01:51.980">So </span><span begin="01:51.980" end="01:52.250">now </span><span begin="01:52.250" end="01:52.430">up </span><span begin="01:52.430" end="01:52.550">in </span><span begin="01:52.550" end="01:52.610">the </span><span begin="01:52.610" end="01:53.030">courts</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.030" end="01:54.770"><span begin="01:53.030" end="01:53.330">Pleading </span><span begin="01:53.330" end="01:53.420">my </span><span begin="01:53.420" end="01:53.690">case </span><span begin="01:53.690" end="01:53.750">in </span><span begin="01:53.750" end="01:53.810">a </span><span begin="01:53.810" end="01:54.230">witness </span><span begin="01:54.230" end="01:54.770">box</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.980" end="01:56.390"><span begin="01:54.980" end="01:55.262">Telling </span><span begin="01:55.262" end="01:55.544">the </span><span begin="01:55.544" end="01:55.826">judge </span><span begin="01:55.826" end="01:56.108">and </span><span begin="01:56.108" end="01:56.390">jury</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.390" end="01:57.980"><span begin="01:56.390" end="01:56.480">The </span><span begin="01:56.480" end="01:56.690">same </span><span begin="01:56.690" end="01:56.900">thing </span><span begin="01:56.900" end="01:56.990">that </span><span begin="01:56.990" end="01:57.020">i </span><span begin="01:57.020" end="01:57.260">said </span><span begin="01:57.260" end="01:57.350">to </span><span begin="01:57.350" end="01:57.440">the </span><span begin="01:57.440" end="01:57.980">cops</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.100" end="01:59.570"><span begin="01:58.100" end="01:58.250">On </span><span begin="01:58.250" end="01:58.310">the </span><span begin="01:58.310" end="01:58.520">day </span><span begin="01:58.520" end="01:58.640">that </span><span begin="01:58.640" end="01:58.700">i </span><span begin="01:58.700" end="01:58.910">got </span><span begin="01:58.910" end="01:59.570">arrested</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.750" end="02:01.190"><span begin="01:59.750" end="01:59.960">I'm </span><span begin="01:59.960" end="02:00.380">innocent </span><span begin="02:00.380" end="02:00.500">i </span><span begin="02:00.500" end="02:01.190">protested</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.220" end="02:02.450"><span begin="02:01.220" end="02:01.430">She </span><span begin="02:01.430" end="02:01.610">just </span><span begin="02:01.610" end="02:01.850">feels </span><span begin="02:01.850" end="02:02.450">rejected</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.480" end="02:03.380"><span begin="02:02.480" end="02:02.660">Had </span><span begin="02:02.660" end="02:02.840">her </span><span begin="02:02.840" end="02:03.020">heart </span><span begin="02:03.020" end="02:03.200">broken </span><span begin="02:03.200" end="02:03.380">by</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.380" end="02:04.670"><span begin="02:03.380" end="02:03.650">Someone </span><span begin="02:03.650" end="02:03.860">shes </span><span begin="02:03.860" end="02:04.340">obsessed </span><span begin="02:04.340" end="02:04.670">with</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.940" end="02:06.170"><span begin="02:04.940" end="02:05.060">She </span><span begin="02:05.060" end="02:05.270">likes </span><span begin="02:05.270" end="02:05.540">sound </span><span begin="02:05.540" end="02:05.630">on </span><span begin="02:05.630" end="02:05.690">my </span><span begin="02:05.690" end="02:06.170">music</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.320" end="02:07.760"><span begin="02:06.320" end="02:06.500">She </span><span begin="02:06.500" end="02:06.680">makes </span><span begin="02:06.680" end="02:06.860">out </span><span begin="02:06.860" end="02:07.040">a </span><span begin="02:07.040" end="02:07.220">fan </span><span begin="02:07.220" end="02:07.400">of </span><span begin="02:07.400" end="02:07.580">my </span><span begin="02:07.580" end="02:07.760">music</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.820" end="02:09.320"><span begin="02:07.820" end="02:08.030">So </span><span begin="02:08.030" end="02:08.150">i </span><span begin="02:08.150" end="02:08.330">love </span><span begin="02:08.330" end="02:08.540">them </span><span begin="02:08.540" end="02:08.870">diamonds </span><span begin="02:08.870" end="02:08.960">to </span><span begin="02:08.960" end="02:09.200">lose </span><span begin="02:09.200" end="02:09.320">it</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.320" end="02:11.000"><span begin="02:09.320" end="02:09.440">Cos </span><span begin="02:09.440" end="02:09.530">she </span><span begin="02:09.530" end="02:09.740">cant </span><span begin="02:09.740" end="02:10.070">seperate </span><span begin="02:10.070" end="02:10.160">the </span><span begin="02:10.160" end="02:10.340">man </span><span begin="02:10.340" end="02:10.460">from </span><span begin="02:10.